	(text "Sensors sheet (step 5): ST LIS2DW12 on the shared 2.0 V I2C bus. Pinout from ST datasheet DocID029682 Rev 4, table 2."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 15.24 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.5 1.5)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "bbd64518-1d57-4d2b-989e-2a646eb33a87")
	)
	(text "- VDD (pin 9) and VDD_IO (pin 10) on VDD_2V0; C401 at pin 9 (VDD), C402 at pin 10 (VDD_IO).\n- C403 10 uF bulk on VDD near pin 9, per ST's application hint (100 nF + 10 uF).\n- CS (pin 2) tied to VDD_2V0: I2C mode (SPI disabled).\n- SDO/SA0 (pin 3) tied to VDD_2V0: I2C address 0011001b = 0x19 (0x18 if SA0 were low).\n  CS and SA0 also have internal pull-ups (about 49k at 1.8 V, 30k at 2.5 V); the hard strap avoids depending on them.\n- SDA/SCL on I2C_SDA/I2C_SCL. No pull-ups here: R203/R204 on the power sheet serve the whole bus.\n- INT1 -> ACC_INT1 (SoC wake GPIO P1.07). INT2 -> ACC_INT2, test pad TP401 only.\n- Pin 5 NC: datasheet allows VDD, VDD_IO or GND; tied to GND. Pin 7 RES: connect to GND (datasheet).\n- Pins 6 and 8 GND."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 147.32 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "d93a186b-98dc-4eae-b6ff-99f74dfe7678")
	)
